              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "先 — xiān — \"first; before anything else\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "我们先吃饭 wǒmen xiān chīfàn — Let's eat first."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 先 (xiān) — six strokes: a short stroke falling to the left, a short bar, a vertical and a long bar; then 儿 at the foot. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
            }
          ]
        },
